{"id":"q9db79afc1a","q":"A takes twice as much time as B or thrice as much time as C to finish a piece of work. Working together, they can finish the work in 2 days. B can do the work alone in :","o":["8 days","6 days","4 days","12 days"],"a":1,"e":"ধরি A একা কাজটি t দিনে করে; তাহলে B করে t/2 দিনে, C করে t/3 দিনে। একদিনে তিনজনের কাজ 1/t + 2/t + 3/t = 6/t = 1/2, তাই t = 12 এবং B এর লাগবে 12/2 = 6 দিন।","s":"গণিত","qn":58},
